package FlowCheck public system Child features i: in event port; o: out event port; flows f: flow path i -> o; end Child; system Top features i: in event port; o: out event port; flows f: flow path i -> o; end Top; system implementation Top.i subcomponents u: system Child; v: system Child; connections c1: port i -> u.i; c2: port v.o -> o; flows f: flow path i -> c1 -> u.f -> c2 -> o; end Top.i; end FlowCheck;
